__pycache__/
*.pyc
.mise.local.toml

# Pre-close check receipts (vitalharmony/hrse#1208). Derived state; the tool
# is cross-repo, so the artifact lands here too. Without this rule the receipt
# shows as untracked, a `git add -A` commits it, and the tool's own dirty-tree
# guard then refuses on an artifact it created itself.
.claude/cache/
# harmonic-forge#883: the transaction log is rendered from git at read time
# (`mise run transaction-log`); a stray local copy must never be committed.
transaction-log.md
# harmonic-forge#1288: failure data never enters this public repo. The logs,
# the derived SQLite store and the overlays live in operator-memory.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
protocol-failures*.jsonl
failure-overlays/
# harmonic-forge#1289: the never-refuse sample holds command text; it lives in
# operator-memory/never-refuse/. Covers the sample, its manifest and temp files.
never-refuse-sample*
